{"seq":53,"slug":"workflow-orchestration-engines","title":"工作流引擎与编排","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 工作流引擎与编排\n\n一笔跨服务的电商下单，背后是扣库存、收款、发货、积分、通知五个独立系统的协作。任何一步崩溃、超时或重启，都不能让用户的钱和货对不上账。当这种「多步骤、长周期、必须可靠」的业务越来越多，手写重试循环、状态字段和定时轮询很快就会失控——工作流引擎正是为收编这种复杂度而生的一类基础设施。\n\n这个 hub 把工作流引擎拆成四条由浅入深的主线，刻意按「先有概念、再有模式、然后落到具体引擎、最后谈运营」的顺序铺开。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基。它回答三个最根本的问题：协作到底由谁来指挥（编排还是协同）、一个工作流在引擎眼里长什么样（DAG 还是状态机）、以及让进程崩了也能从断点继续的核心机制（持久化执行与确定性重放）。这三块是后面一切讨论的词汇表。\n\n第二章「核心模式」把地基变成能表达真实业务的语言。任务之间怎么排依赖、怎么调度；分布式事务没有数据库级回滚时怎么用 Saga 与补偿来兜底；流程卡在「等人审批」「等三天后再催」「等外部回调」时，又如何用人工任务、定时器和信号把它们建模成一等公民。这三种模式覆盖了绝大多数现实流程的形状。\n\n第三章「引擎生态」把抽象落到真刀真枪的产品上。市面上的引擎大致分三类光谱：以 Airflow、Dagster、Prefect 为代表的数据编排器，以 Temporal、Cadence 为代表的持久工作流引擎，以及 Step Functions、Argo 这类云原生与 Kubernetes 原生方案。理解它们各自的设计取舍，才能在选型时不被营销话术带偏。\n\n第四章「生产实践」是长期运营的收口。工作流一旦上线就会持续演进，于是有了版本管理与不破坏在途实例的演进策略；出了问题要能看清、能复盘，于是有了可观测性与调试；流量与故障来了要扛得住，于是有了扩展性与可靠性。这一章讲的是把引擎真正养活在生产里的功夫。\n\n四章环环相扣：没有基础的词汇，模式无从谈起；没有模式的表达力，引擎只是空壳；没有对引擎的理解，运营就是盲修；而运营反过来又会逼着你重新审视最初的模型选择。建议初学者顺序通读，有经验的读者可循文中的交叉链接按需跳转。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"orchestration-vs-choreography","title":"编排与协同：两种协作范式","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/foundations/orchestration-vs-choreography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"workflow-models","title":"工作流模型：DAG 与状态机","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/foundations/workflow-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"durable-execution","title":"持久化执行与确定性重放","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/foundations/durable-execution"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"核心模式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"task-scheduling","title":"任务调度与依赖编排","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/patterns/task-scheduling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"saga-compensation","title":"Saga 与补偿事务","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/patterns/saga-compensation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-timers-signals","title":"人工介入、定时器与信号","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/patterns/human-timers-signals"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engines","title":"引擎生态","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-orchestrators","title":"数据编排：Airflow、Dagster、Prefect","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/engines/data-orchestrators"},{"seq":2,"slug":"durable-workflow-engines","title":"持久工作流引擎：Temporal 与 Cadence","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/engines/durable-workflow-engines"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cloud-serverless-orchestration","title":"云原生编排：Step Functions 与 Argo","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/engines/cloud-serverless-orchestration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"生产实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-evolution","title":"工作流版本管理与演进","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/operations/versioning-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-debugging","title":"可观测性与调试","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/operations/observability-debugging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scaling-reliability","title":"扩展性与可靠性","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/workflow-orchestration-engines/operations/scaling-reliability"}]}]}